00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:29,260
Judging by the looks of you, you're useless.

271
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:34,260
And if you don't have any skills to show, then quit the Demon Slayer core.

272
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:38,260
You can't even use breathing techniques right, and you're not a real swordsman.

273
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:40,260
I can't, but...

274
00:15:43,260 --> 00:15:45,260
Hey, hold on before you go.

275
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:49,260
I've been wanting to apologize to you all this time.

276
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:51,260
That's it, Genya. Don't give up!

277
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:54,260
I really couldn't care less.

278
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:56,260
Now get lost.

279
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:58,260
But brother, I...

280
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:00,260
I've even eaten demons.

281
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:03,260
Just to be able to fight.

282
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:05,260
You what?

283
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:07,260
What did you just say?

284
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:09,260
You bastard.

285
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:11,260
Demons!

286
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:12,260
Demons!

287
00:16:12,260 --> 00:16:13,260
You've eaten demons!

288
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:15,260
You've eaten demons!

289
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:16,260
He's gone!

290
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:17,260
Genya!

291
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:19,260
What did you just say?

292
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,260
You bastard.

293
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:24,760
Demons!

294
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:34,260
You've eaten demons!

295
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:37,760
He's gone!

296
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,760
Genya!

297
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:50,260
How many more days is this torture gonna last, huh?

298
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,760
He's back! He's back! He's back!

299
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:59,760
Quick, lie down and pretend you passed out!

300
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:01,760
It's the only way we'll be spared!

301
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:07,760
Is that Tanjiro?

302
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:08,760
What the?

303
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:10,760
You'll be killed, Tanjiro!

304
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:13,260
What are you doing destroying the building like that?

305
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:14,760
Please, calm down!

306
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:19,260
Huh?

307
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:20,260
Hold on.

308
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:23,260
What's that twisted, ominous sound that's coming from inside?

309
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:29,260
Ah!

310
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:31,260
The old guy's on a rampage!

311
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:34,260
We're getting clobbered during and after training!

312
00:17:34,260 --> 00:17:36,260
What do you think you're doing?

313
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:38,260
You could've killed him!

314
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:41,260
If I wanted him dead, he would be.

315
00:17:41,260 --> 00:17:43,260
We're not allowed to kill trainees,

316
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:45,260
but I have something else planned.

317
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:48,260
I'm going to break him beyond recovery!

318
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:50,260
I tell you what,

319
00:17:50,260 --> 00:17:53,260
if he quits the Demon Slayer core right here and now,

320
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,260
I'll let him go.

321
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:56,260
How dare you!

322
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:58,260
There's no way you have that kind of authority!

323
00:17:58,260 --> 00:18:00,260
You can't force him to quit!

324
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:03,260
And you just said yourself that you had no brother!

325
00:18:03,260 --> 00:18:06,260
So you have no say in what choices Genya makes!

326
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:08,260
Whether he has skills or not,

327
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:11,260
he's decided to risk his life fighting demons!

328
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,260
If you're not his brother,

329
00:18:13,260 --> 00:18:16,260
then I'm not letting you stand in his way!

330
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:17,260
Without Genya,

331
00:18:17,260 --> 00:18:20,260
that upper rank would've beaten us!

332
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:22,260
So I won't let you hurt him!

333
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:24,260
Genya's my friend!

334
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:27,260
Is that right?

335
00:18:27,260 --> 00:18:32,260
Then I'll just go ahead and break you beyond recovery first!

336
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:37,260
Here he comes!

337
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:38,260
Focus!

338
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:44,260
Tanjiro!

339
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:47,260
Damn brat!

340
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:49,260
He stopped my fist!

341
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:53,260
Whoa!

342
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:55,260
He landed a blow!

343
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:56,260
Zenitsu!

344
00:18:58,260 --> 00:19:01,260
Get Genya out of here quickly!

345
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:03,260
Are you stupid or something?

346
00:19:03,260 --> 00:19:05,260
Don't call me by my name in front of him!

347
00:19:05,260 --> 00:19:07,260
There's gotta be a better way to signal to me!

348
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:08,260
Fudge your house!

349
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:16,260
He only grazed me, but that kick ripped my ear!

350
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:20,260
You've really got some nerve taking me on like this!

351
00:19:20,260 --> 00:19:22,260
If you've got a death wish,

352
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:25,260
I'd love to help you out with that!

353
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:26,260
Stop it, brother!

354
00:19:26,260 --> 00:19:28,260
You got nothing to do with this!

355
00:19:28,260 --> 00:19:29,260
Let's go!

356
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:31,260
Who are you?

357
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:32,260
Let go of me!

358
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:36,260
The enemy won't be able to focus on us all at once if we split up!

359
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:37,260
So that guy's your big brother?

360
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:39,260
He's a total lunatic!

361
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,260
I feel bad you had to-

362
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:43,260
Don't you dare insult my older brother!

363
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:45,260
I'm on your side, you idiot!

364
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:47,260
Just die already!

365
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:54,260
From that point on, it was a frenzy of chaos and turmoil.

366
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:58,260
The brawl nearly lasted until dusk.

367
00:19:58,260 --> 00:20:01,260
What were you thinking back there, you idiot?!

368
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:04,260
I received a formal reprimand from the higher-ups.

369
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:07,260
My training under the Wind Hashira was suspended,

370
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:10,260
and I was banned from going near him again.

371
00:20:13,260 --> 00:20:16,260
In the end,

372
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:20,260
I wasn't able to bring the Shinazugawa brothers together, as I'd hoped.

373
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:27,260
Not only did I get us kicked out of his training sessions,

374
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:30,260
but my mark still isn't any clearer,

375
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:33,260
and I feel like I haven't grown at all from my training.

376
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:34,260
You definitely have.

377
00:20:34,260 --> 00:20:37,260
After all, you took on the old Wind guy, right?

378
00:20:37,260 --> 00:20:38,260
That's incredible.

379
00:20:38,260 --> 00:20:40,260
You really think so?

380
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:43,260
Just how deep in the mountains is a Stonehenger's house?!

381
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:44,260
Is he a hermit?!

382
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:46,260
I think it's just a bit farther.

383
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:47,260
What?

384
00:20:47,260 --> 00:20:49,260
Is something wrong?

385
00:20:49,260 --> 00:20:51,260
I hear something up ahead.

386
00:20:52,260 --> 00:20:53,260
This way!

387
00:20:57,260 --> 00:20:59,260
It's… a waterfall!

388
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:03,260
Hey, look!

389
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:06,260
This way of Zoge'don's cry…

390
00:21:06,260 --> 00:21:07,260
Thus have I heard,

391
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:08,260
in the presence of the Buddha!

392
00:21:08,260 --> 00:21:10,260
Weeding Shubhast the action of thought,

393
00:21:10,260 --> 00:21:11,260
tfhatsgrabble v'hara!

394
00:21:11,260 --> 00:21:12,260
Thus have I heard!

395
00:21:14,260 --> 00:21:16,260
If you are able to extinguish your heart and mind…

396
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:29,020
heart and mind. Even fire becomes tolerable. Welcome, boys, to my training ground.

397
00:21:46,260 --> 00:22:16,240
Thank you.

398
00:22:16,260 --> 00:22:46,240
Thank you.

399
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:48,260
Thank you.

400
00:22:48,260 --> 00:22:50,260
Thank you.

401
00:22:50,260 --> 00:23:20,260


402
00:23:20,260 --> 00:23:22,260
Thank you.

403
00:23:22,360 --> 00:23:25,900
He says that his left and right eyes have been different colors since birth.

404
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:30,960
If that's everything, then get out of here and stay away from Kanroji.

405
00:23:31,300 --> 00:23:32,260
But we're friends.

406
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,840
So you are planning on seeing her.

407
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:35,980
Whoa!

408
